## Test Suite

### Install Test Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
pip install -r Applications/CRUD_APP/requirements.txt
pip install -r Applications/CPU_APP/requirements.txt
pip install -r Applications/QUEUE_APP/requirements.txt
pip install -r Applications/LLM_APP/requirements.txt
```

### Run Tests

```bash
# Default run: non-slow tests with coverage (70% minimum)
pytest

# Include slow tests too
pytest -m "slow or not slow"
```

### Run By App

```bash
pytest tests/crud
pytest tests/cpu
pytest tests/queue
pytest tests/llm
```

### Run By Marker

```bash
pytest -m unit
pytest -m api
pytest -m asyncmock
pytest -m "not slow"
```

### Troubleshooting

- If imports fail, run tests from repo root (`CS551FinalProj`).
- If SQLite errors occur, remove stale local `items.db` and rerun.
- Queue tests are mocked and do not require Redis.
- LLM tests mock Gemini calls and do not require a real API key.
